# Normalize line endings on the way into the repo. The governance file set
# is generated by an external tooling skill that emits CRLF; without this,
# every regeneration reintroduces it into files that are otherwise LF.
# Declaring it here fixes it at the boundary rather than relying on each
# run remembering to convert.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary-ish assets that must never be touched.
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
